- **"trading chart"** → `components/trading-chart.tsx`
- **"wallet"** → `components/wallet-connector.tsx` or `hooks/useWallet.ts`
- **"config"** → `config/index.tsx`
- **"the plan"** → `.cursor/project_plan.md`
- **"tasks"** → `.cursor/tasks.md`

