## 🎯 Phase-Specific Instructions

### Phase 0: Testing (Current)
- Focus on test coverage
- Setup CI/CD pipelines
- Deploy to Sepolia frequently
- Document test results

### Phase 1: Deployment
- Double-check everything
- Test CREATE2 on Sepolia first
- Have rollback plan
- Monitor gas prices

### Phase 2: Migration
- Validate holder data thoroughly
- Test with small batches
- Have recovery process
- Keep community informed

### Phase 3: Liquidity
- Calculate optimal LP amounts
- Monitor oracle accuracy
- Setup price alerts
- Document LP parameters

### Phase 4: QA
- Follow manual test checklist
- Test on all major browsers
- Document all bugs
- Prioritize critical issues

